These cats have a [[Talents|Talent]] called Resist Knockback, not to be confused with the [[Special Abilities|Ability]] [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|Immune to Knockback]]. Unlike Immune to Knockback, this Talent only reduces how far the cat is pushed away by an enemy's knockback ability. It has no effect on damage-based knockbacks.
